24/xs_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Harness.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2124/sm_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Harness.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2124/md_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Harness.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2124/lg_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Harness.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2124/xl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Harness.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/2124/xxl_IVP_Background_Logos_520px_040126_Harness.jpg","A decade ago, developers built software applications with a monolithic approach, releasing their code perhaps every six or twelve months. Today, tech giants have primed consumers to expect rapid updates and constant access to the latest technologies. The capability to increase the pace of delivery, sometimes by a thousandfold, has become a strategic advantage for tech-forward companies—and a disadvantage for enterprises that can’t keep up with consumer expectation.\r\n\r\nHarness, the industry’s first software delivery platform to use AI for simplifying DevOps processes, is democratizing continuous delivery by providing a freemium SaaS solution for automation. It also enables software engineering teams to deliver code to customer-facing applications more efficiently and securely, improving the quality of their software in production. Harness is perfectly positioned to help its B2B customers better understand, manage and automate the evolving software lifecycle, and we’re excited to have the opportunity to invest in and support their team on a remarkable journey.","Harness is the industry’s first software delivery platform to use AI for simplifying DevOps processes, and is democratizing automation with its freemium solution.","Harness - IVP Portfolio - Software Startup Funding","Harness - IVP Portfolio ","The first continuous delivery platform enabling DevOps teams to efficiently and securely deliver code to customer-facing applications ",{"id":32,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"311","2019-01-01","https://careers.ivp.com/companydetail.php?cid=20485&v=34","/portfolio/traceable","Learn more about Traceable","Jyoti Bansal","/content/harnessing-continuous-delivery/","Read the Funding Announcement","https://www.linkedin.com/company/harnessinc/",{"id":42,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":43,"assetUrlXs":44,"assetUrlSm":45,"assetUrlMd":46,"assetUrlLg":47,"assetUrlXl":48,"assetUrlXxl":49},"313","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/313/Harness.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/313/xs_Harness.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/313/sm_Harness.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/313/md_Harness.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/313/lg_Harness.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/313/xl_Harness.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/313/xxl_Harness.jpg","Founded 2016\r\nPartnered 2019\r\nAcquired Traceable 2025","Harness","harness",{"id":54,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":9,"assetUrlXs":9,"assetUrlSm":9,"assetUrlMd":9,"assetUrlLg":9,"assetUrlXl":9,"assetUrlXxl":9},"310",{"name":56,"slug":57},"Active","active",[59,62,65,68],{"fullName":60,"slug":61},"Somesh Dash","somesh-dash",{"fullName":63,"slug":64},"Steve Harrick","steve-harrick",{"fullName":66,"slug":67},"Tom Loverro","tom-loverro",{"fullName":69,"slug":70},"Shreyas Garg","shreyas-garg",{"id":72,"alt":8,"caption":9,"assetUrl":73,"assetUrlXs":74,"assetUrlSm":75,"assetUrlMd":76,"assetUrlLg":77,"assetUrlXl":78,"assetUrlXxl":79},"312","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/312/Harness.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/312/xs_Harness.jpg","https://assets.ivp.com/system/uploads/fae/image/asset/312/sm_Harness.jp